# Per-host .env profiles (e.g. .env.mac / .env.local used by
# scripts/jarvis-profile to point this service at a local or remote stack).
# These hold REAL tokens and DB passwords, and were untracked but NOT ignored —
# one `git add .` from publishing secrets to a public repo.
.env.*
!.env.example
